invariant: INV-8
file: handshake.c
catches: webpki_session_pq
reason: the retry hello that a HelloRetryRequest naming x25519 asked for goes
  out under legacy_record_version 0x0301 when the retry carried no cookie,
  because the cookie alone marked a hello as the retry. RFC 9846 section
  5.1 admits 0x0301 only on the initial ClientHello.

--- old
    t->tx[2] = h->cookie_len > 0 || h->share_group != CH_KEX_GROUP ? 0x03 : 0x01;
--- new
    t->tx[2] = h->cookie_len > 0 ? 0x03 : 0x01;
